lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/88e364bc.py:112:    - All yellow pixels in that region slide in that direction, stacking against the far wall.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/88e364bc.py:113:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/88e364bc.py:114:    Key insight: Legend fill color links to region border color; the center→indicator offset encodes the movement vector.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/88e364bc.py:115:    \"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/88e364bc.py:116:    g = np.asarray(grid, dtype=int)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/88e364bc.py:117:    h, w = g.shape\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/88e364bc.py:118:    bg = get_bg(g)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/88e364bc.py:119:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/88e364bc.py:120:    mover = 4  # yellow in ARC\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/88e364bc.py:121:    dirs = _legend_directions(g, bg)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/88e364bc.py:122:    assert dirs, \"legend_directions must find at least one legend; grid should always have border legends\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/88e364bc.py:123:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/88e364bc.py:124:    passable = (g == bg) | (g == mover)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/88e364bc.py:125:    out = g.copy()\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/88e364bc.py:126:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/88e364bc.py:127:    # Find enclosed passable regions (not connected to the outer border).\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/88e364bc.py:128:    for pts in components_mask(passable, connectivity=4):\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/88e364bc.py:129:        if any(r == 0 or c == 0 or r == h - 1 or c == w - 1 for r, c in pts):\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/88e364bc.py:130:            continue  # outside background\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/88e364bc.py:131:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/88e364bc.py:132:        movers = [(int(r), int(c)) for r, c in pts if int(g[r, c]) == mover]\