e hollow 3x3 foreground symbols.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/train/afe3afe9.py:110:    - The symbols lie on a coarse row/column lattice; fully empty lattice rows or columns are absent from the output.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/train/afe3afe9.py:111:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/train/afe3afe9.py:112:    Rule\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/train/afe3afe9.py:113:    - Replace each hollow 3x3 symbol with one pixel of its color in the corresponding coarse-grid cell.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/train/afe3afe9.py:114:    - The marker edge gives the compaction direction by clockwise border travel: top -> right, right -> down, bottom -> left, left -> up.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/train/afe3afe9.py:115:    - Preserve the order of non-background pixels while sliding them as far as possible in that direction.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/train/afe3afe9.py:116:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/train/afe3afe9.py:117:    Key insight\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/train/afe3afe9.py:118:    - The large picture is a scaled symbolic grid, and the blue edge marker acts as a gravity direction rather than as output content.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/train/afe3afe9.py:119:    \"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/train/afe3afe9.py:120:    g = np.asarray(grid, dtype=int)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/train/afe3afe9.py:121:    symbolic, side, bg = _symbolic_grid(g)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/train/afe3afe9.py:122:    return _compact(symbolic, side, bg)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/train/afe3afe9.py:123:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/train/afe3afe9.py:124:# --------------- generator (att2) ---------------\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/train/afe3afe9.py:125:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/train/afe3afe9.py:126:# Canvas and colors.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/train/afe3afe9.py:127:GEN_BG = 0\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/train/afe3afe9.py:128:GEN_GRID_SHAPE = (30, 30)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/train/afe3afe9.py:1